            "detailed_description": "You are an adventure seeker who travels the world in search of forgotten &amp; lost treasures. Search for hidden objects and circumvent unique puzzle traps to recover the most sought after treasures the world has ever known.<br>\t\t\t\t\tA newly-discovered fragment of an ancient map is believed to reveal the location of the Lost Tomb of Egypt. Under the direction of the Museum, you must immediately begin your adventure to locate the Lost Tomb and the treasures locked within! Complete over 100 levels by finding hidden objects and circumventing unique puzzle traps. Good luck on your adventure!<br>\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Find over 2000 hidden objects in over 100 levels.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Explore 22 unique Egyptian locations.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Circumvent 7 unique mini-game puzzle traps to continue your missions.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Two game modes: &quot;Find the Lost Tomb&quot; and &quot;Secret Game&quot; mode.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Find the hidden Scarabs to unlock Secret Game mode and a bonus Egyptian location.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Strive for the Perfect Search Bonus by not using the 'Hint' button.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Play against the clock or in Relaxed Mode with no time limits.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Unlock interesting facts about Egypt in your journal.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "You are an adventure seeker who travels the world in search of forgotten &amp; lost treasures. Search for hidden objects and circumvent unique puzzle traps to recover the most sought after treasures the world has ever known.<br>\t\t\t\t\tA newly-discovered fragment of an ancient map is believed to reveal the location of the Lost Tomb of Egypt. Under the direction of the Museum, you must immediately begin your adventure to locate the Lost Tomb and the treasures locked within! Complete over 100 levels by finding hidden objects and circumventing unique puzzle traps. Good luck on your adventure!<br>\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Find over 2000 hidden objects in over 100 levels.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Explore 22 unique Egyptian locations.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Circumvent 7 unique mini-game puzzle traps to continue your missions.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Two game modes: &quot;Find the Lost Tomb&quot; and &quot;Secret Game&quot; mode.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Find the hidden Scarabs to unlock Secret Game mode and a bonus Egyptian location.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Strive for the Perfect Search Bonus by not using the 'Hint' button.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Play against the clock or in Relaxed Mode with no time limits.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Unlock interesting facts about Egypt in your journal.</li></ul>",
